Now it's not worth zip.

496
00:30:11,143 --> 00:30:12,907
Well, bend it back.

497
00:30:13,078 --> 00:30:17,106
That is ridiculous, Clara.
I can't begin to bend it.

498
00:30:18,517 --> 00:30:19,917
Oh.

499
