509
00:30:53,085 --> 00:30:54,383
You're a rotten doctor.

510
00:30:54,553 --> 00:30:55,953
You're a rotten husband.

511
00:30:56,121 --> 00:31:00,456
And as a matter of fact, I have
never seen anything so stupid or ugly

512
00:31:00,625 --> 00:31:05,654
as you in London in
your oilskin and galoshes.

513
00:31:51,143 --> 00:31:53,203
<i>- Duncan, is that you?</i>
- Yes, it's me.

514
00:31:53,378 --> 00:31:54,846
<i>Come on up.</i>

515
00:32:09,928 --> 00:32:11,419
Duncan.

516
00:32:11,596 --> 00:32:13,861
Hey, Duncan, you look great.

517
00:32:27,379 --> 00:32:30,440
Hey, hey, hey, we got
