518
00:32:30,615 --> 00:32:34,143
- I, um... I was...
- What are you, some kind of a pervert?

519
00:32:34,319 --> 00:32:35,446
No, I'm a lawyer.

520
00:32:35,620 --> 00:32:38,784
You come on here.

521
00:32:40,258 --> 00:32:42,159
We don't allow none
of that around here.

522
00:32:48,567 --> 00:32:50,934
Oh, yeah.

523
00:32:51,436 --> 00:32:52,870
If I could just...

524
00:32:53,038 --> 00:32:57,806
If I could just check
that right here, see how...

525
00:32:59,377 --> 00:33:00,606
