- You said you wanted to leave.

534
00:33:27,072 --> 00:33:29,064
That's when you wanted to leave.

535
00:33:29,241 --> 00:33:31,335
Now that I wanna
stay, you wanna stay?

536
00:33:31,510 --> 00:33:35,003
Well, it's my house.

537
