never be free from pain

545
00:34:08,580 --> 00:34:10,708
and most certainly
confined to a wheelchair."

546
00:34:11,483 --> 00:34:13,816
Just like that. No hope.

547
00:34:13,985 --> 00:34:17,581
Despite all the advances
in medical knowledge.

548
00:34:17,756 --> 00:34:20,089
