- It is.

549
00:34:20,258 --> 00:34:21,538
You couldn't be mistaken?

550
00:34:21,693 --> 00:34:24,822
I've been a practicing
physician for 40 years

551
00:34:24,996 --> 00:34:27,795
and have probably published more
articles on spinal and neck injuries

552
00:34:27,966 --> 00:34:31,368
than anyone in this state.
I don't think I'm mistaken.

553
00:34:32,437 --> 00:34:36,670
Dr. Harrison, how many times have
