- Objection.

573
00:35:37,769 --> 00:35:41,297
Withdraw the question.
Nothing further, Your Honor.

574
00:35:42,007 --> 00:35:45,808
This court stands in recess
until 10 a.m. Monday morning.

575
00:35:51,349 --> 00:35:53,909
