I think he's very courageous
to do something about it.

610
00:39:12,917 --> 00:39:15,443
Why didn't you just
tell her to start with?

611
00:39:15,620 --> 00:39:17,612
At first, I was embarrassed.

612
00:39:17,789 --> 00:39:21,556
And then before I knew it,
things got completely out of hand.

613
00:39:22,093 --> 00:39:24,858
Come, Duncan. I'll
take you to lunch.

614
00:39:28,466 --> 00:39:31,459
Thank you. Thank you
for being so understanding.

615
00:39:31,636 --> 00:39:34,196
- Ah.
- This has been a catharsis for me.

616
00:39:34,372 --> 00:39:37,501
Oh, and a personal
breakthrough for me.

617
00:39:39,544 --> 00:39:42,036
You've all been wonderful.

618
00:39:42,213 --> 00:39:43,909
Goodbye.

619
00:39:49,854 --> 00:39:51,447
Huh.

620
00:40:12,443 --> 00:40:15,504
Did you, uh, get
something to eat?

621
00:40:15,680 --> 00:40:19,173
- Dad, I'm trying to work.
- Oh.

622
00:40:21,185 --> 00:40:22,847
Um...

623
