641
00:41:44,736 --> 00:41:48,434
- Not so good. LEANNE:
I'm sorry to hear that.

642
00:41:48,606 --> 00:41:50,370
Have you ever been
in pain like this before?

643
00:41:50,541 --> 00:41:53,841
Never. Not even close.

644
00:41:54,012 --> 00:41:57,881
And until you've felt it, there's
no way of imagining how bad it is,

645
00:41:58,049 --> 00:42:01,042
