- You're sure?

649
00:42:10,895 --> 00:42:13,490
Uh, not that I know of.

650
00:42:17,135 --> 00:42:21,266
I'd like to show you something
that may refresh your memory.

651
00:42:21,439 --> 00:42:25,376
