in an accident before.

656
00:42:49,167 --> 00:42:52,365
Was this done as some
sort of joke, Mr. Fuqua?

657
00:42:52,937 --> 00:42:54,701
A costume party, perhaps?

658
00:42:54,872 --> 00:42:57,171
I, uh... I don't remember.

659
00:42:57,341 --> 00:43:00,436
Well, it was a few
years ago in Boston.

660
00:43:00,611 --> 00:43:03,911
And of course you had a
different name then, Fred Logan.

661
00:43:04,082 --> 00:43:06,278
Does any of this ring a bell?

662
00:43:06,451 --> 00:43:09,915
Uh... Come on now.

663
00:43:10,088 --> 00:43:12,387
I was watching your
tape the other night,

664
00:43:12,557 --> 00:43:15,026
and I saw an old cane in
the closet. Got me to thinking:

665
00:43:15,193 --> 00:43:17,662
Maybe you had been
