666
00:43:19,730 --> 00:43:22,461
Uh, I don't recall.

667
00:43:22,633 --> 00:43:25,797
Seeing that cane prompted
me to do a little detective work.

668
00:43:25,970 --> 00:43:27,939
So I called a lot of
