- Yeah. Ha, ha.

714
00:46:04,929 --> 00:46:06,557
You're...

715
00:46:07,932 --> 00:46:09,400
You're a fine lawyer.

716
00:46:10,067 --> 00:46:11,592
I know.

717
00:46:12,069 --> 00:46:14,766
